        "fileName": "Aslains_WoT_Modpack_Installer_v.2.3.1.3_11.exe",
        "updatedAt": "2026-09-01T08:41:12.607Z",
        "changeLog": "- Updated Dynamic Playlists\n- Updated Camo Selector (Fixed 3D attachments not updating correctly in Exterior. Improved 3D style and customization-item compatibility. Prevented invalid outfit data from causing preview or rendering errors. Improved Purchase & Exit safety checks. Added descriptions for custom assets)\n- Updated Vehicle Stat Inspector (added a loadout sandbox with equipment variants and full crew customization, plus major fixes and performance improvements)\n- Updated Tank Info in Garage\n- Updated BalCalcMod (small fix for the menu)\n- Reverted Overmatch to 1.5.0 (1.5.1 left the game process running after quitting)\n"
      },
      "current": {
        "modVersion": "01",
        "wotGameVersion": "2.4.0.0",
        "fileName": "Aslains_WoT_Modpack_Installer_v.2.4.0.0_01.exe",
        "updatedAt": "2026-09-02T15:49:51.896Z",
        "changeLog": "- Updated x5 XP Multiplier Counter by OldSkool\n- Updated contour icons: man1aq\n- Updated Little Helper Collection (proper)\n- Updated Armor Inspector Wotinspector\n- Updated Average Damage Log\n- Updated Mod Menu 2.0.3 (fix for utf8 in a path)\n- Fixed Custom UI Scale installer radio button (was forced accidentaly)\n- Removed outdated mods: iyouxin's mod (breaks mouse controls in battle), Repairs by Protanki (game won't load), The Old Battle Results Windows (errors in logs), Reload Time\n"
